    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Use AI to Code Your Web App - Style \r\n\r\n1. **Prompt AI for CSS**  \r\n   - Ask AI to create the style for your web app. Highlight the text in `prompt.md` and click \"Send to AI Tutor\" or copy and paste it directly into the AI Tutor chat.\r\n\r\n   - Clarify that you want AI to generate the `styles.css` file.\r\n\r\n3. **Accept and Save**  \r\n   - Briefly describe what AI changed, e.g. `Created style.css for garden web app` Then click **\"Accept and save version\"**. \r\n   \r\n_Note: Your HTML code should carry over from the previous level._",
